[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m ### Step 2: Use the second case.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m She walks at $ s + 2 $ km/h, total time = **2 hours and 24 minutes** = **2.4 hours**.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m Similarly, the walking time is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} = 2.4 - \frac{t}{60} \tag{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m We now have two equations:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m \frac{9}{s} = 4 - \frac{t}{60} \tag{1}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} = 2.4 - \frac{t}{60} \tag{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m Subtracting equation (2) from equation (1):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m \frac{9}{s} - \frac{9}{s + 2} = \left(4 - \frac{t}{60}\right) - \left(2.4 - \frac{t}{60}\right)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m = 4 - 2.4 = 1.6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m \frac{9}{s} - \frac{9}{s + 2} = 1.6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 9\left(\frac{1}{s} - \frac{1}{s + 2}\right) = 1.6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m \frac{1}{s} - \frac{1}{s + 2} = \frac{1.6}{9}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m Simplify:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m \frac{1}{s} - \frac{1}{s + 2} = \frac{8}{45}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m \frac{2}{s(s + 2)} = \frac{8}{45}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m \frac{1}{s(s + 2)} = \frac{4}{45}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m s(s + 2) = \frac{45}{4} = 11.25
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m Solve the quadratic:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m s^2 + 2s - 11.25 = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m Using the quadratic formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m s = \frac{-2 \pm \sqrt{2^2 + 4 \cdot 11.25}}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m = \frac{-2 \pm \sqrt{4 + 45}}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m = \frac{-2 \pm \sqrt{49}}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m = \frac{-2 \pm 7}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m - $ s = \frac{-2 + 7}{2} = \frac{5}{2} = 2.5 $ km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m - $ s = \frac{-2 - 7}{2} = -4.5 $ km/h (discard since speed can't be negative)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m Thus, $ s = 2.5 $ km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
