[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m ### Step 4: Use equation (1) to find $ t $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m From equation (1):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m \frac{9}{s} = 4 - \frac{t}{60}
