[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m We know $ s = 2.5 $, so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m \frac{9}{2.5} = 3.6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 3.6 = 4 - \frac{t}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m \Rightarrow \frac{t}{60} = 4 - 3.6 = 0.4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m \Rightarrow t = 0.4 \cdot 60 = 24 \text{ minutes}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
