[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m - **For 5**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m \left\lfloor \frac{9}{5} \right\rfloor = 1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m $$
