[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 4. If two snakes **touch**, they **merge**. Once merged, the new snake is the **union** of both original snakes, which can have **length greater than 1**.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=74714)[0m 5. The process ends when only **one snake remains**.
